# Grid Table Portal Development Mode

## Scope
- Apply to `portal/src/`.
- Keep portal docs/demo implementation aligned with library architecture.

## Standards
- Use alias imports and avoid long relative paths.
- No magic numbers/strings in pages/components; use constants.
- Keep component/types/constants split (`Name.tsx`, `Name.types.ts`, `Name.const.ts` when applicable).
- Use Bear primitives for controls and interactive UI where possible.
- Prefer `clsx` for conditional class composition.
- Avoid inline style objects in TSX; prefer classes/utilities and extracted style helpers.

## Validation
- Run `npm run build` in portal after substantial changes.
- Verify local library package integration before release.
